{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_06_end","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_06","title":"厭食","storyCode":"SV-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"e490f52b318091d7571a701bef274cfc63ea3d09c40ef74de10eec0e44bbf374","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"受到安妮塔的熱情感染，斯卡蒂來到了人群中，為當地居民唱了一首歌。久違的音樂為居民們麻木的心靈帶來了一絲悸動，卻遭到漲潮的訊息打斷。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對象是人的話，力道和角度很難控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅了嗅自己）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不流血了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們為什麼還這麼興奮？這裡的恐魚本來就這麼多嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是昨天那種怪物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前沒見過哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天你們不要到這裡來了。快回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要拽我的裙子。你不是那麼小的小孩子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我是想說......我想好我要什麼了。我想聽你唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"因為......我不知道什麼是歌。我聽到你在夢裡哼了。但我聽不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你答應了？這是不是就是約定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（皺眉）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？是啊，歌手，你的琴去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我回去找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我幫你一起找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這是不是說，你願意跟我一起回去啦？太、太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的......值得這麼高興？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，牆灰，早上好呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，鐵皮去哪裡了？你們之前一直形影不離啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你盯著的方向......是海......嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，昨天抽到紅色貝殼的人，是鐵皮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"木框，我的病好像更嚴重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我的胸口很漲，像是要爆開一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我連東西都不想吃。你不要和我說話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，歡迎再次來到我們家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你奶奶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶還在休息呢。昨天我們一起回到這裡，她就一直躺著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，她也消耗了很大體力，肯定很累了。我沒想到她會衝出來，對審判官那樣說話。她變得和平時都不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的對。她很......厲害。她打退了審判官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"打退了......審判官？！歌手，你這麼說，要是讓審判官聽見，她一定又要生氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是她想再動手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她不會再來找你麻煩了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......找誰的麻煩都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸箱子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我們出去找琴吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你頭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！好多綠色的黏黏的東西......這、這是什麼東西呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是海藻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是剛才摔跤時候蹭到的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這些......有用嗎？看起來和海草長得差不多。能不能等風吹乾了拿來鋪床？佩特拉奶奶腰不舒服，正好用得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你用貝殼將這些海藻磨碎。不要洗掉這些粘液。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上一點海水，記得沒過海藻。裝進這個小罐子裡，封好口。放半年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等罐子裡的液體的綠色淡了，說明發酵好了，就可以喝啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？是不是沒聽明白？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你好像從來沒一口氣對我說過這麼多話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝殼也不用扔，洗淨曬乾，當喝酒的容器用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"酒？那是什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡寫著。這裡原先是所酒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"原來這個字是酒的意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說喝酒能帶來快樂，忘記煩惱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，味道還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前經常喝這個嗎？在你的家鄉......阿戈爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不大一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有時候會一起喝類似的，在跳舞之前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你們那時候一定很快樂。噢，我明白啦！不是酒能帶來快樂，是快樂的時候，我們喝酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在外面的人，呃，是不是都會喝酒？大家是不是都很快樂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了。那他們一定沒有我現在這麼快樂。歌手，謝謝你教我做這個酒。我真想馬上就和你一起喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手勢錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼碾的話，很難碾碎。你可以換個角度，用最尖的部分對準海藻的紋理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌握韻律，調整呼吸......令你的手，你的身體，與觸到你肌膚的海風融為一體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像這樣——一擊，即碎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你盯著我，是還想動手嗎？只有你一個人的話，結束得很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"不......沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，還給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"是鐵皮撿到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"他昨天夜裡看到你把這東西掉在了外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，太好了！歌手，我們不用去找琴了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮他，他把這東西偷偷拿回了我們住的房子，讓我......讓我把它給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"說完這個他就走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（撥琴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這個調子......咦，是你晚上睡著時候哼著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它經常在我腦子裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你和你的同伴，你們以前會唱的歌嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在家的時候，這樣的歌還有很多。我們用歌聲......對彼此說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開以後，其他歌聲都消失了。我一個人，只剩下這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪，這首歌聽起來很讓人難過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（撥琴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，我們的約定！你拿回了琴，是不是可以為我們唱歌了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可都等著哩，是吧，佩特拉奶奶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶今天說不出話了。不然她一定也想跟著唱哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，佩特拉奶奶想聽呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_05"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個獵人他走上海岸♪\n他的家鄉在後，他的路在身前♪\n父母與兒女都與他失散♪\n他的戀人已經葬身大海♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情有一絲變化。你是否感受到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"並不意外，你的神經依舊遲鈍。看看你面前的這些水。水位的起伏，波紋的頻率，光澤的躍動。這些都是訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"快要漲潮了。我們該上去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_05"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個獵人他走上海岸♪\n他的家鄉在後，徒餘哀歎♪\n他的路沒有盡頭♪\n他的路濃霧彌漫♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"她在唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"她竟然，在這個破房子裡，在這些人面前唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人......他們也竟然在聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"低著頭的人依然低著頭。不會說話的人依然凍著舌頭。歌聲明明沒法進到他們僵硬的軀殼裡。可他們的眼睛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"他們，聽懂了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她......睡著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我很少見她睡得這麼安穩。以前她一閉眼就會大叫，在空氣裡亂抓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為聽見你唱歌，她會想要跳舞。她總是嚷嚷著想跳舞哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"牆灰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我要死了。我的眼睛......進了海水。好鹹，一點都不好喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，你這是......你是不是哭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"哭？什麼是哭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是從你身體深處流淌出來的情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣......嗎？我還是不大明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，我喜歡你的歌。你不愛說話，可是你的歌裡有許多話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你願意再唱一遍嗎？我想聽你說更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（撥琴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"吃的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"有吃的到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"去海灘上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"教士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
